Z||000078||JSocha||08-27-2001||05:48 PM||||Here is my spin on this age thing, taking it from her apparent known age to Roger's suspected age.  Right now, Roger is probably a little over half her age 19/40=0.53.<P>However, as time goes on, by the time she is 64 and he is 85, she will only be 1/4 of his age.<P>19......40......0.53<BR>24......45......0.47<BR>29......50......0.42<BR>34......55......0.38<BR>39......60......0.35<BR>44......65......0.32<BR>49......70......0.30<BR>54......75......0.28<BR>59......80......0.26<BR>64......85......0.25<BR><p>[This message has been edited by JSocha (edited 08-27-2001).]||||reg||10
